sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    %% Layers: API -> Application -> Domain -> Infrastructure -> Common
    participant Client as Cliente
    participant API as "erp-api<br/>CommandOrderControllerV1<br/>(vars: createOrderCommand:CreateOrderCommand, id:String, reason:String, status:String)"
    participant App as "erp-application<br/>CreateOrderUseCase.execute(CreateOrderCommand)<br/>UpdateOrderStatusUseCase.execute(UpdateOrderStatusCommand)<br/>CancelOrderUseCase.execute(CancelOrderCommand)"
    participant Domain as "erp-domain<br/>OrderRoot extends AggregateRoot<OrderId> -> Entity<OrderId]<br/>OrderItem extends Entity<OrderItemId><br/>ValueObjects: OrderNumber, Customer, OrderStatus, Money, Quantity"
    participant Infra as "erp-infrastructure<br/>OrderRepository (implements OrderCatalogRepositoryPort) / PaymentGateway / InventoryClient"
    participant Common as "erp-common<br/>Commands/DTOs: CreateOrderCommand{OrderItemRequest}, CancelOrderCommand(orderId,reason), UpdateOrderStatusCommand(id,status)"

    Note over Client,API: Flujo: crear orden, cancelar, actualizar estado

    Client->>API: POST /commands/orders { CreateOrderCommand(customerId, items[], createdBy) }
    API->>Common: validar y mapear request -> CreateOrderCommand (record) // OrderItemRequest(productId, quantity)
    API->>App: CreateOrderUseCase.execute(createOrderCommand)
    App->>Domain: OrderFactory.create(orderNumber, customer, items, createdBy) -> OrderRoot.create(...)
    Note over Domain: OrderRoot (AggregateRoot) crea OrderItem(s) (Entity)
    Domain->>Infra: OrderRepository.save(orderRoot) // persist aggregate
    Infra-->>Domain: persisted OrderId
    Domain-->>App: returns OrderId
    App-->>API: returns id
    API-->>Client: 201 Created Location: /commands/orders/{id}

    Note over Client,API: Cancelar orden
    Client->>API: PATCH /commands/orders/{id}/cancel?reason={reason}
    API->>Common: new CancelOrderCommand(id, reason) (record)
    API->>App: CancelOrderUseCase.execute(cancelCommand)
    App->>Infra: OrderRepository.findById(id)
    Infra-->>App: orderRoot
    App->>Domain: orderRoot.cancel(reason)  // OrderRoot.cancel -> register OrderCancelled event
    Domain->>Infra: OrderRepository.save(orderRoot)
    App-->>API: void
    API-->>Client: 204 No Content

    Note over Client,API: Actualizar estado
    Client->>API: PATCH /commands/orders/{id}/status?status={status}
    API->>Common: new UpdateOrderStatusCommand(id, status)
    API->>App: UpdateOrderStatusUseCase.execute(command)
    App->>Infra: OrderRepository.findById(id)
    Infra-->>App: orderRoot
    App->>Domain: orderRoot.updateStatus(OrderStatus.valueOf(status)) // domain transitions: confirm/ship/deliver
    Domain->>Infra: OrderRepository.save(orderRoot)
    App-->>API: void
    API-->>Client: 204 No Content
